11:02.666 --> 11:09.600
PADHAMAM HAVEI MANGALAM

11:10.400 --> 11:14.866
Experience the peace that arises within you.

11:15.133 --> 11:18.400
Now, vigorously rub your palms together

11:18.400 --> 11:22.633
and feel the warmth generated between
them.

11:23.433 --> 11:26.366
Now, place your palms over your eyes

11:26.933 --> 11:28.733
and let all the warmth,

11:28.733 --> 11:33.133
all the positive energy merge within you.

11:34.866 --> 11:36.800
Now, gently open your eyes

11:37.200 --> 11:39.966
and feel the presence of that positive energy.
